{"schema_version":"1.0.0","metadata":{"trial_id":"202610081400-old-west-saloon-effort-medium","prompting_method_id":"concept-build-free.v0","model_id":"claude-sonnet-5-5","seed":11,"server_state_id":"concept-free.v1"},"style":{"name":"Old West frontier saloon","rationale":"Second pass keeps the silver stone-brick field, dark timber frame and warm spruce deck. Fixes: (1) flat side walls now have corner and mid-wall dark_oak posts, a floor-line beam and rhythmic glass windows. (2) The roofline is resolved: a stepped low gable with stair eaves sits behind a taller parapet. The parapet has a dark_oak stair cornice, slab cap and stepped centre peak, and a chimney breaks the ridge. (3) Depth comes from a 3-deep porch, posts and a beam, a railed balcony with corner lanterns, full-height pilasters, shutters off the wall face and a sign standing proud with trim. (4) The ground floor invites you in through a dark doorway with swinging trapdoor doors and a balcony door above on the same axis. Hanging lanterns, barrels, a bench, hay and hitching rails add life without noise. Pilasters and porch posts share the x lines 4 and 9, and the bays are symmetric about x 6.5."},"palette":{"manifest":["minecraft:stone_bricks","minecraft:dark_oak_log","minecraft:dark_oak_planks","minecraft:spruce_planks","minecraft:spruce_stairs","minecraft:dark_oak_stairs","minecraft:dark_oak_slab","minecraft:glass_pane","minecraft:dark_oak_trapdoor","minecraft:spruce_trapdoor","minecraft:spruce_door","minecraft:lantern","minecraft:red_banner","minecraft:dark_oak_fence","minecraft:hay_block","minecraft:barrel","minecraft:flower_pot","minecraft:oak_wall_sign"]},"placements":[{"op":"box","from":[0,0,0],"to":[13,9,15],"block":"minecraft:stone_bricks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,0,1],"to":[12,0,14],"block":"minecraft:dark_oak_planks"},{"op":"fill","from":[1,5,1],"to":[12,5,14],"block":"minecraft:dark_oak_planks"},{"op":"fill","from":[0,5,0],"to":[13,5,0],"block":"minecraft:dark_oak_planks"},{"op":"line","from":[0